  });
```

**The key difference**:
- **Icons**: Use CSS class approach (`<span class="instui-icon -icon-name">`) with the mask painter, works via CSS
- **Logos**: Use `<img src="...">` with explicit width/height metadata because Canvas RCE strips SVG and CSS backgrounds
- Icons rely on CSS being present in editor; logos are self-contained raster images

