**Generated output structure**:
- Per-logo CSS files: `dist/canvas-horizontal-color.css`
- Rasterized PNGs: `dist/canvas-horizontal-color.png`
- Per-product bundles: `dist/canvas.css`
- Combined sheet: `dist/logos.css`
- Embedded metadata: `generated/embedded.ts` (exported as `LOGOS` array)

